  "@_LIVEACTIVITY_PRIVACY": {},
  "la_privacy_header": "Live Activity privacy policy",
  "la_privacy_intro": "To use the Live Activity feature, we need to store and process certain data. Please read the information below carefully.",
  "la_privacy_section1_title": "What data do we store?",
  "la_privacy_section1_body": "To operate Live Activity, we store the following data together with your device identifier:\n\n• Device identifier (UUID)\n• Device token\n• Live Activity push token\n• APNs push token\n• Device hash\n• Language setting\n• Bell delay\n\nYour timetable data (lessons table) contains:\n• Lesson subject and time\n• Teacher name\n• Room name\n• Lesson number\n• Lesson topic\n• Substitution information\n• Cancelled lesson indicator\n\nScheduled notifications (scheduled_notifications table) contain:\n• Identifier\n• Device identifier\n• Scheduled time\n• Sending status and time\n• Creation and update time",
  "la_privacy_section2_title": "How do we protect your data?",
  "la_privacy_section2_body": "We take the security of your data seriously:\n\n• All data in the devices and lessons tables is encrypted\n• Data is stored on a secure server\n• Data is retained only for as long as necessary",
  "la_privacy_section3_title": "How long do we store the data?",
  "la_privacy_section3_body": "Data storage is limited to the minimum necessary period:\n\n• Live Activity push token: Stored while you have lessons on the given day, including the two-hour period before your first lesson. If you have no more lessons, the value becomes null.\n\n• Timetable data: Stored only for the duration of the lessons and then automatically deleted. On Friday, after the last lesson, the timetable table is completely emptied.\n\n• Device data (tokens, identifiers): Stored while Live Activity is enabled. When the feature is disabled, this data is immediately deleted.",
  "la_privacy_section4_title": "What do we use the data for?",
  "la_privacy_section4_body": "We use the data exclusively to operate the Live Activity feature:\n\n• Displaying your live timetable on the lock screen\n• Sending push notifications when lessons change\n• Synchronizing the timetable on your device\n• Ensuring Monday morning notifications are delivered even after the weekly database cleanup\n\nWe do not share your data with third parties and do not use it for marketing purposes.",
  "la_privacy_section5_title": "Your rights",
  "la_privacy_section5_body": "Under the GDPR, you have the following rights:\n\n• Right of access: You can see the types of stored data in this privacy policy.\n• Right to erasure: Disabling Live Activity immediately and permanently deletes all data related to the feature, including device identifiers and timetable data, from our servers.\n• Right to rectification: Timetable data is modified in the Kréta system by authorized persons, such as teachers.\n• Right to object: You can object to data processing at any time by disabling Live Activity.",
  "la_privacy_footer": "Privacy policy last updated: November 2025",
  "la_privacy_contact": "Have a question? Contact us at support @firka.app.",
  "la_privacy_summary1": "Device tokens, Live Activity tokens, timetable data",
  "la_privacy_summary2": "Encrypted storage, secure servers",
  "la_privacy_summary3": "Data is automatically deleted when it is no longer needed",
